OL,3,A'Everyone in for Christmas' - Burnham
OL,4,Aunveils rough sleeping plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FShadow housing secretary James
OL,7,FCleverley said there was "little
OL,8,Fdetail" about how the initiative would
OL,9,Fbe paid for or delivered.
